estores +0.4 Morale per hour to another Operator assigned to that Dormitory whose Morale is not full (Only the strongest effect of this type takes place); furthermore, self Morale recovered per hour +0.2"}],"modules":[],"review":{"official":"Initially a patient at\nRhodes Island\n, Popukar requested and passed the trial to become an\nOperator\nfor Rhodes Island. She was assigned to\nOp Reserve Team A6\n.\nShe possesses tremendous destructive power, becoming the team's heavy.","editor":null,"rating":null},"synergies":[],"techniques":[{"technique":null,"techniqueDescription":null,"description":null}],"guides":[],"stats":{"phases":[{"elite":0,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":40,"base":{"hp":1130,"atk":263,"def":126,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":17,"block":2,"interval":1.2},"max":{"hp":1449,"atk":366,"def":181,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":17,"block":2,"interval":1.2},"rangeId":"1-1"},{"elite":1,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":55,"base":{"hp":1449,"atk":366,"def":181,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":19,"block":2,"interval":1.2},"max":{"hp":1858,"atk":495,"def":245,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":19,"block":2,"interval":1.2},"rangeId":"1-1"}],"trust":{"hp":0,"atk":50,"def":0}},"files":[{"section":"Clinical Analysis","unlock":"Unlocked at 25 trust","description":"Imaging test for this Operator showed blurry outline of internal organs with visible unusual dark spots. Unusually high concentration of Originium particles were present in her circulation, indicating signs of infection and confirming her as infected at this stage. \n\n[Cell-Originium Assimilation] 3% \nCrystallization visible on surface of body, with many symptoms of Oripathy. \n\n[Blood Originium-Crystal Density] 0.2u/L \nSubject is currently stabilized, but regular observation and treatment are required."},{"section":"Archive File 1","unlock":"Unlocked at 50 trust","description":"A member of Reserve Op Team A6. Although not capable of complex reasoning, her infection bestowed on her an ability that made her a suitable Operator. \nThe source of a lot of problems for Team A6, most of these are unintentional. Because of her sincerity, she is also the easiest to forgive."},{"section":"Archive File 2","unlock":"Unlocked at 100 trust","description":"Unlike most other members, Popukar was taken in by Dr. Kal'tsit personally.\n Dr. Kal'tsit did not explain why she made this choice, only saying Popukar would stay on as a full-time member of Rhodes Island. \nHowever, Dr. Ansel said that was the first time she had ever seen Dr. Kal'tsit visibly upset."},{"section":"Archive File 3","unlock":"Unlocked at 150 trust","description":"Although Popukar failed her Operator exam, she was allowed to work in logistics, rather than being cast out. \nAnd as it is so rare for an infection to make a patient stronger, even rarer to the extent of Popukar's infection, she is a very valuable case study."},{"section":"Archive File 4","unlock":"Unlocked at 200 trust","description":"Popukar has gradually become one of the mascots of Rhodes Island. After all, no one could hate such an energetic little cutie -- even if she occasionally engages in 'minor' vandalism. \nMoreover, since joining A6, she has a much bigger family. Their shenanigans are just part of the Rhodes Island color nowadays."}]},"appearances":[{"label":"Base","iconPath":"/three-star-icons/Popukar%20-%20Base.webp","fullPath":"/three-star-skins/Popukar%20-%20Base.webp"},{"label":"The Bamboo Spiritualist","iconPath":"/three-star-icons/Popukar%20-%20The%20Bamboo%20Spiritualist.webp","fullPath":"/three-star-skins/Popukar%20-%20The%20Bamboo%20Spiritualist.webp"},{"label":"Witch's Swing","iconPath":"/three-star-icons/Popukar%20-%20Witch's%20Swing.webp","fullPath":"/three-star-skins/Popukar%20-%20Witch's%20Swing.webp"}],"skinObtainByLabel":{"Witch's Swing":"18 OP"},"synergyMatches":[],"autoSynergyGroups":[{"name":"Rhodes Island","type":"faction","entries":[{"operatorName":"Closure","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Closure%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":true,"badges":[{"label"